Cell["\<\
Each support contains the decimal labels of the affine-plane generators used \
in one compact exact certificate. These labels lie in {1,...,60}, are listed \
in increasing order, and refer to the generator ordering fixed above.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e2305265-df79-43d8-8b19-0f700a6ab1b5"],

